<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light" />
    <title>Pidro update emails</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; background: #f3eee4; color: #1c2a3a; font: 18px/1.6 Nunito, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; }
      main { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px 12px 40px; }
      .logo { display: block; width: 200px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto 18px; }
      .card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e6ddc9; border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px 28px; }
      h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.25; }
      p { margin: 0 0 20px; }
      .sv { margin-top: 4px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #efe7d6; }
      form { margin: 8px 0 0; }
      button { display: block; width: 100%; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 12px; font: inherit; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.3; cursor: pointer; }
      .primary { background: #e1ad3a; border: 1px solid #a86b17; color: #1e0e04; }
      .secondary { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #c8b48c; color: #1c2a3a; }
      button span { display: block; font-weight: normal; font-size: 16px; }
      footer { padding: 26px 16px 0; text-align: center; color: #7a5a36; font-size: 14px; }
      footer a { color: #7a5a36; }
      @media (max-width: 480px) { .card { padding: 26px 20px; } h1 { font-size: 23px; } }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main data-state={@state}>
      <img class="logo" src={~p"/images/logo-email.png"} width="200" height="124" alt="Pidro" />
      <div class="card">
        <%= case @state do %>
          <% :ask -> %>
            <h1>Stop Pidro's update emails?</h1>
            <p>
              Now and then we email news about Pidro. Mail you ask for, like a password reset
              or a sign-in code, still arrives.
            </p>
            <div class="sv" lang="sv">
              <h1>Sluta få Pidros uppdateringsmejl?</h1>
              <p>
                Ibland mejlar vi nyheter om Pidro. Mejl du själv ber om, som att återställa
                lösenordet eller en inloggningskod, kommer ändå.
              </p>
            </div>
            <form method="post" action={~p"/unsubscribe/#{@token}"}>
              <input type="hidden" name="choice" value="off" />
              <button type="submit" class="primary">
                Stop update emails <span lang="sv">Sluta få uppdateringsmejl</span>
              </button>
            </form>
          <% :off -> %>
            <h1>Update emails are off</h1>
            <p>You won't get Pidro's update emails any more. Mail you ask for still arrives.</p>
            <div class="sv" lang="sv">
              <h1>Uppdateringsmejlen är avstängda</h1>
              <p>Du får inte längre Pidros uppdateringsmejl. Mejl du själv ber om kommer ändå.</p>
            </div>
            <form method="post" action={~p"/unsubscribe/#{@token}"}>
              <input type="hidden" name="choice" value="on" />
              <button type="submit" class="secondary">
                Turn them back on <span lang="sv">Slå på dem igen</span>
              </button>
            </form>
          <% :on -> %>
            <h1>Update emails are on again</h1>
            <p>You'll get Pidro's occasional update emails again.</p>
            <div class="sv" lang="sv">
              <h1>Uppdateringsmejlen är på igen</h1>
              <p>Du får Pidros uppdateringsmejl igen.</p>
            </div>
            <form method="post" action={~p"/unsubscribe/#{@token}"}>
              <input type="hidden" name="choice" value="off" />
              <button type="submit" class="secondary">
                Stop update emails <span lang="sv">Sluta få uppdateringsmejl</span>
              </button>
            </form>
          <% :invalid -> %>
            <h1>This link is not valid</h1>
            <p>Use the link in the newest email from Pidro, or write to {@support_email}.</p>
            <div class="sv" lang="sv">
              <h1>Den här länken är inte giltig</h1>
              <p>
                Använd länken i det senaste mejlet från Pidro, eller skriv till {@support_email}.
              </p>
            </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
      <footer>
        Pidro, the card game from Ostrobothnia<br /> Questions? Write to
        <a href={"mailto:#{@support_email}"}>{@support_email}</a>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
